A1. A knock that is not a boost. ~ RAP
A4. Agrees. ~ ASSENTS
A10. Topsy's side kick. ~ EVA
A13. These fish could squirm out of anything. ~ EELS
A14. "Soupy, soupy, soupy—without a single bean." ~ PUREE
A15. What Sweet Mamma steps out with. ~ FEET
