A19. Many a sucker gets caught in this. ~ NET
A20. Behold. ~ LO
A21. Never colorful. ~ PALE
A22. What the other fellow is when he doesn't speak to you. ~ SNOB
A24. Providence is in this state (init.). ~ RI
A25. Something trains runs on. ~ RAIL
A27. How she got her divorce. ~ SUED
A29. Any snail can do a mile in this. ~ SHELL
A31. Found in the saloon on Saturday nights. ~ BAR
A33. To analyze—as a sentence. ~ PARSE
A35. Judge could never be printed if it wasn't for this. ~ PULP
A36. A South Sea Island. ~ SAMOA
A38. The charge of the police brigade. ~ RAID
A39. You can't get much on this these days. ~ MAIDEN
